(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-cultivation-32","book":"mountain-ledger","cn":["顾衡赶着载粮的[[cattle|牛]]入城，每袋不按外商的[[bushel|蒲式耳]]糊涂换算，先在同一杆秤上称。车后搭了一处孩子的[[nursery|临时保育室]]，罗清借[[candle|蜡烛]]核对封口，一名车夫的[[mate|同伴]]交上庙井水单。补给还有一只浅水[[canoe|小舟]]，顾衡没说自己奉[[emperor|皇帝]]号令，只拿三方签字。陶溯称院租没有[[ceiling|上限]]，一[[flock|群]]家属挤到门前。季禾用[[charcoal|木炭]]写出实收数量，人人都可数见，不能让粮进大门后便成了谁的私恩。","陶溯的谢粮文满是[[literary|文绉绉的]]话，孩子的[[chatter|说笑]]却在看见压伤者后安静。罗清摸他的[[forehead|额头]]，比昨晚仍烫，不能庆贺全好了。顾衡带来干[[chestnut|栗子]]和新绷布，要保留分配的[[flexibility|灵活性]]，不是所有人一律同份。院后[[chimney|烟囱]]冒着陌生的黑烟，守井人说库门夜里很[[mysterious|诡秘]]地开过。许庭灭掉[[cigaret|纸烟]]，认出库外的[[writing|字迹]]，是自己运输副手的。院里的[[clock|时钟]]刚报午时，他问副手为何比自己先到，后者说只来送盐，不知阀件。","顾衡把上游村的[[federal|联盟的]]公印一起带来，幌子不是只替自己村求水。罗清以干[[cloth|布]]替孩子擦手，这次共议的[[culture|习惯]]从能否互相帮助开始。工人帮病者[[clothe|穿衣]]，沈砚挽起[[sleeve|袖子]]清点新[[clothing|衣物]]。一位[[fisherman|渔民]]拿木[[club|棍]]支床，同来的人属于城中[[minority|少数群体]]，名字常在口头分配时被省略。顾衡按原名念全，没人替他们改成本地好读的音。两车[[coal|煤]]和粮车分开，免得煤灰再落到饭里，火仓给他们留下的教训不能只写在报告上。","有人要求病户的[[reference|证明人]]都到议事[[chamber|厅]]里领粮，罗清把孩子歪掉的[[collar|衣领]]理好，说床上的人不能再搬去配合[[publicity|宣传]]。顾衡的[[cotton|棉布]]包里夹着一把[[spade|铁锹]]，季禾另拿[[cutter|切割器]]，准备修暗沟。陶溯要查工人的[[qualification|资格]]，沈砚请他先[[declare|申报]]阀件在哪。城中[[fame|名声]]好的人也得留实物；许庭副手鞋上的[[dust|尘灰]]混有柜中旧漆，季禾提出共同开库，不在门外凭鞋灰直接定罪。","库门后有水带来的[[mud|泥]]，阀件一角的[[edge|边缘]]却很干。沈砚记住断案册里[[criminology|刑事学]]的一条实际教训：物件位置能改，搬运单也要对。仓库不该[[exclusively|专供]]某人的买卖。陶溯的[[assistant|助手]]终于[[express|说出]]昨夜[[command|命令]]，掌事要先将阀装去私院。公井停用不是物件自然[[extinction|消失]]，是有人搬走。顾衡请不同户的人同看封条，原件暂留库中不再运走；许庭要求查看自己副手签收的那页，因为此人又用了他的商行印。","院角[[cock|公鸡]]被争声惊得扑翅。副手承认印是照旧委托用的，不肯独背责任。许庭必须面对自己的授权过宽，陶溯也不能只说一切都是伙计办的。查库拖慢配水，城南第二车又晚到，沈砚让顾衡留人先押水车，不把所有能走的人都叫来见证。罗清还在院里救人，伤友的发热终于略缓，腿伤却仍漫长。顾衡问沈砚什么时候回山，他说先让这座城有不用求人买的水。明天他们要找到暗沟真正的旧入口；钥匙拿到并不等于水已经到，第一次开井的失误，他不能再犯。"],"en":["Gu entered with grain-bearing [[cattle|cattle]], weighing sacks rather than ambiguously converting foreign [[bushel|bushel]] measures. A temporary [[nursery|nursery]] followed. Luo checked seals by [[candle|candle]] while a driver’s [[mate|mate]] delivered temple records. A [[canoe|canoe]] accompanied supplies. Gu carried three signatures, no [[emperor|emperor]]’s order. Tao claimed unlimited rent [[ceiling|ceiling]]. Before a [[flock|flock]] of families, Ji wrote receipts in [[charcoal|charcoal]] so delivered grain could not become private favour.","Tao’s [[literary|literary]] thanks silenced children’s [[chatter|chatter]] when they saw the injured man. His [[forehead|forehead]] remained hot; recovery was not complete. Gu brought [[chestnut|chestnut]] and bandages with distribution [[flexibility|flexibility]], not identical portions for every patient. A [[chimney|chimney]] smoked above a [[mysterious|mysterious]] midnight opening. Xu extinguished his [[cigaret|cigaret]] and recognized his deputy’s [[writing|writing]]. At the [[clock|clock]]’s noon strike, the deputy claimed only a salt delivery and ignorance of valves.","Gu brought a [[federal|federal]] village seal. Luo used clean [[cloth|cloth]] as a cooperative [[culture|culture]] began in ordinary help. Workers helped patients [[clothe|clothe]] themselves; Shen raised a [[sleeve|sleeve]] to count [[clothing|clothing]]. A [[fisherman|fisherman]] supported a bed with a [[club|club]]. A [[minority|minority]] group’s names had often vanished in spoken allocations; Gu read each unchanged. Two [[coal|coal]] carts stayed separate from food. Lessons from the fire must change handling, not only reports.","Officials wanted every sick household’s [[reference|reference]] in the [[chamber|chamber]] for grain. Straightening a child’s [[collar|collar]], Luo refused to move patients for [[publicity|publicity]]. Gu’s [[cotton|cotton]] bundle held a [[spade|spade]]; Ji brought a [[cutter|cutter]]. Tao questioned their [[qualification|qualification]]. Shen asked him first to [[declare|declare]] the valves’ location. [[fame|Fame]] did not replace objects. The deputy’s shoe [[dust|dust]] contained old paint; Ji requested witnessed storage access, not conviction from dirt.","Inside, [[mud|mud]] surrounded a valve whose [[edge|edge]] was dry. Shen recalled a practical [[criminology|criminology]] lesson: positions could change, so compare delivery records. Storage could not serve [[exclusively|exclusively]] private trade. Tao’s [[assistant|assistant]] would finally [[express|express]] the midnight [[command|command]] to move parts to a private yard. Public equipment’s [[extinction|extinction]] was removal, not decay. Gu secured shared custody. Xu asked to inspect the page signed with his seal.","A [[cock|cock]] fluttered at the raised voices. The deputy claimed continuing authorization and refused sole blame. Xu confronted overly broad delegation; Tao could not dismiss everything as servants’ acts. Inspection delayed water, so Shen sent Gu’s people to escort the second cart instead of summoning every witness. Luo remained with patients. The worker’s fever eased slightly but his leg needed time. Asked about home, Shen wanted first a city supplied without private pleading. Tomorrow they would find the old ditch entrance. Keys did not equal flowing water; he must not repeat that mistake."]});
